    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/435bed5457f1a2c40bb906ee80fd9921.poster.avif?t=1742522575\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/435bed5457f1a2c40bb906ee80fd9921.webm?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/435bed5457f1a2c40bb906ee80fd9921.mp4?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Welcome, Investigator!</strong></i>\u00a0  <br>  <br>You work for an organization called,\u00a0<strong>&quot;The Order,&quot;</strong> a paranormal investigation company that strictly deals with entities &amp; objects called <strong>&quot;Anomalies.&quot;</strong>\u00a0These anomalies are manifestations of pure chaos, and it's <i><strong>our</strong></i> job to contain &amp; eliminate them.<i>\u00a0... we're losing control of the situation. Fast.\u00a0<br>  </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/00637173e34e34ddb2a4259b1e3434af.poster.avif?t=1742522575\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/00637173e34e34ddb2a4259b1e3434af.webm?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/00637173e34e34ddb2a4259b1e3434af.mp4?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0  <br> </strong>In the<strong> Order HQ, </strong>you'll be able to upgrade your equipment, study on known &amp; unknown entities, shop for allies &amp; other important materials, edit your character's classes &amp; skill trees, &amp; much more. You can also just hang out &amp; socialize with other fellow investigators if you feel like it!\u00a0 <br>      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/464fd4cfe8bd6e5ec0294d1f817796a4.poster.avif?t=1742522575\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/464fd4cfe8bd6e5ec0294d1f817796a4.webm?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/464fd4cfe8bd6e5ec0294d1f817796a4.mp4?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Rico's Theater</strong>\u00a0is a large facility that will actively change with every investigation that you initiate. No investigation will be the same. You will have multiple tasks &amp; objectives to complete in each investigation of which vary in difficulty &amp; skill. Your primary objective will be to lure any anomalies using the appropriate equipment &amp; to eliminate them once they show themselves.<br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/97bde5aaebb9e53d3f0017d99f6fbd3c.poster.avif?t=1742522575\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/97bde5aaebb9e53d3f0017d99f6fbd3c.webm?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/97bde5aaebb9e53d3f0017d99f6fbd3c.mp4?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>The longer your investigation lasts</strong>, the more dangerous &amp; difficult the anomaly(s) will become. Eliminate any threats you encounter. Remember, you will not always be dealing with one single anomaly. There will most likely be multiple depending on your investigation.\u00a0 <br> <br> <br><strong>Good luck, investigator.</strong> We're excited to work with you.\u00a0      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/07401f5e182001319a2ee6cb3681803d.poster.avif?t=1742522575\" width=724 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/07401f5e182001319a2ee6cb3681803d.webm?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/07401f5e182001319a2ee6cb3681803d.mp4?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
