y threats you encounter. Remember, you will not always be dealing with one single anomaly. There will most likely be multiple depending on your investigation.\u00a0 <br> <br> <br><strong>Good luck, investigator.</strong> We're excited to work with you.\u00a0      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/07401f5e182001319a2ee6cb3681803d.poster.avif?t=1742522575\" width=724 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/07401f5e182001319a2ee6cb3681803d.webm?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384340/extras/07401f5e182001319a2ee6cb3681803d.mp4?t=1742522575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
